<title>USA: AES Corp files $750 mln shelf equity/debt.</title>
<headline>AES Corp files $750 mln shelf equity/debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AES Corp filed Monday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $750 million in common stock, preferred stock, debt securities and stock purchase contracts and units.</p>
<p>The Arlington, Va.,-based independent, global power company said it will use net proceeds for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The company did not list underwriters.</p>
